  "reasoning": "The defendant illegally captured 70 frogs, which are identified as protected species (black‑spotted frog and golden‑line frog) that have important ecological, scientific and economic value. Under Chinese criminal law, the illegal capture, purchase, transport or sale of nationally protected wildlife constitutes the crime of illegal hunting, buying, transporting or selling of key protected wild animals. No other criminal conduct is described. Therefore the appropriate charge is the offense of illegal hunting/trafficking of protected wildlife.",
